# Photo mode hides the interface and says how to take the photo; the player frames the shot
# (dragging pans), then takes it with Space or a click.
expect photos 0
key p
wait 3
expect photo on
expect photos 0
drag 400,300 300,300
expect photos 0
key space
wait 3
expect photos 1
shot shots/photo_mode.png
click 480,300
wait 3
expect photos 2
key escape
wait 20
expect photo off
expect toast yes
shot shots/after_photo.png
click ui:photo
wait 3
expect photo on
key p
expect photo off
quit
